WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.105
The Barth children were in big trouble.

2
00:00:03.106 --> 00:00:07.624
A huge, angry mother Maiasaura was about to attack them.

3
00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:10.955
"Is there any way out?" shouted Panther.

4
00:00:10.956 --> 00:00:13.362
They could not climb out of the nest.

5
00:00:13.363 --> 00:00:15.025
It was too deep.

6
00:00:15.026 --> 00:00:16.906
They could not hide.

7
00:00:16.907 --> 00:00:20.574
The dinosaur would quickly find them.

8
00:00:20.575 --> 00:00:25.519
"Look! The sun is about to set!" screamed Jane.

9
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.533
"Keep the dinosaur busy.

10
00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:31.372
The sun is going down!" Cy screamed back.

11
00:00:31.373 --> 00:00:33.667
Then he had an idea.

12
00:00:33.668 --> 00:00:37.141
"She took Lamb but didn't hurt him," he said.

13
00:00:37.142 --> 00:00:41.522
"Maybe she thinks he's her baby," Bobby suggested.

14
00:00:41.523 --> 00:00:44.402
"It doesn't matter," yelled Panther.

15
00:00:44.403 --> 00:00:46.496
"We have to get out of here!"

16
00:00:46.497 --> 00:00:48.897
Panther grabbed hold of Lamb.

17
00:00:48.898 --> 00:00:52.055
The dinosaur let out a high scream.

18
00:00:52.056 --> 00:00:54.520
She was angrier than ever.

19
00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:59.598
"Panther! Keep passing the baby around!" Cy shouted.

20
00:00:59.599 --> 00:01:02.563
Panther looked confused.

21
00:01:02.564 --> 00:01:07.413
"The dinosaur won't harm whoever is holding him," he explained.

22
00:01:07.414 --> 00:01:09.816
Panther gave Lamb to Bobby.

23
00:01:09.817 --> 00:01:12.495
Bobby quickly gave him to Jane.

24
00:01:12.496 --> 00:01:14.727
Jane passed him onto Cy.

25
00:01:14.728 --> 00:01:18.084
In turn, he gave Lamb back to Panther.

26
00:01:18.085 --> 00:01:20.873
The children kept passing Lamb around.

27
00:01:20.874 --> 00:01:24.650
"Whee!" giggled Lamb.

28
00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:27.133
He thought they were playing a game.

29
00:01:27.134 --> 00:01:30.066
The dinosaur stopped and looked at them.

30
00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:32.480
Her small eyes followed Lamb.

31
00:01:32.481 --> 00:01:34.773
But she looked confused.

32
00:01:34.774 --> 00:01:38.305
"Come on, sun," prayed Cy.

33
00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:41.497
The sun was just about to set.

34
00:01:41.498 --> 00:01:44.868
Finally, the dinosaur was tired of the game.

35
00:01:44.869 --> 00:01:49.730
Swishing her powerful tail, she ran toward her nest.

36
00:01:49.731 --> 00:01:53.863
She was so close that the children saw her sharp teeth.

37
00:01:53.864 --> 00:01:57.920
Shaking with fear, the children hugged each other tightly.

38
00:01:57.921 --> 00:02:00.197
They closed their eyes.

39
00:02:00.198 --> 00:02:04.389
After a moment, the children realized everything was quiet.

40
00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.152
They opened their eyes.

41
00:02:06.153 --> 00:02:09.243
"She's gone!" shouted Bobby.

42
00:02:09.244 --> 00:02:11.440
They were no longer in danger.

43
00:02:11.441 --> 00:02:14.634
And they were no longer among the giants.

44
00:02:14.635 --> 00:02:17.758
"We're safe!" cried Jane.

45
00:02:17.759 --> 00:02:21.289
The children jumped up and down with joy.

46
00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.876
Panther wiped away tears as she held Lamb.

47
00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:29.208
It felt wonderful to be back in her normal world again.

48
00:02:29.209 --> 00:02:31.094
"We'd better get home,"

49
00:02:31.095 --> 00:02:35.087
Cy said, looking up at the darkening sky.

50
00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:39.444
"Aunt Martha might be worried."

51
00:02:39.445 --> 00:02:45.066
When they got home, Aunt Martha was just returning.

52
00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:48.299
"Did you have a good time?" asked Panther.

53
00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:51.290
"Yes, thank you," she replied.

54
00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:53.588
"How was your day?"

55
00:02:53.589 --> 00:02:56.574
The children looked at each other and grinned.

56
00:02:56.575 --> 00:02:58.440
"Good," said Cy.

57
00:02:58.441 --> 00:03:00.903
"A dinosaur took Lamb.

58
00:03:00.904 --> 00:03:02.881
So we had to rescue him."

59
00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.606
Aunt Martha smiled.

60
00:03:04.607 --> 00:03:06.371
She didn't believe him.

61
00:03:06.372 --> 00:03:11.461
"What an imagination you have," she chuckled.

62
00:03:11.462 --> 00:03:14.855
"Now let's have dinner."

63
00:03:14.856 --> 00:03:18.557
The next morning, the children woke up early.

64
00:03:18.558 --> 00:03:22.891
Since Aunt Martha was still asleep, they sat on the porch.

65
00:03:22.892 --> 00:03:27.066
"Whose turn is it today?" Jane asked excitedly.

66
00:03:27.067 --> 00:03:30.774
"Don't you think we should stop?" said Panther.

67
00:03:30.775 --> 00:03:33.860
"Stop what?" asked Jane.

68
00:03:33.861 --> 00:03:37.158
"Making wishes," answered Panther.

69
00:03:37.159 --> 00:03:39.401
"It's not fun anymore."

70
00:03:39.403 --> 00:03:42.472
The others thought about this matter.

71
00:03:42.473 --> 00:03:45.856
"I have an idea," Cy said finally.

72
00:03:45.857 --> 00:03:48.675
"Each of us can make another wish.

73
00:03:48.676 --> 00:03:51.228
Then we promise to stop."

74
00:03:51.229 --> 00:03:55.359
Everyone except Panther agreed this was a good plan.

75
00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.794
"I think we should stop now," she argued.

76
00:03:58.795 --> 00:04:01.790
"It's not fair," said Bobby.

77
00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:04.983
"Cy already got two wishes."

78
00:04:04.984 --> 00:04:08.933
"Yeah, it's not fair!" Jane whined.

79
00:04:08.934 --> 00:04:11.990
In the end, Panther gave in.

80
00:04:11.991 --> 00:04:16.378
After a quick breakfast, the children walked to Huey's well.

81
00:04:16.379 --> 00:04:20.034
Cy pulled up Huey.

82
00:04:20.035 --> 00:04:24.243
"How were the dinosaurs?" Huey asked with a wink.

83
00:04:24.244 --> 00:04:28.184
"We had a great time," Cy replied stubbornly.

84
00:04:28.185 --> 00:04:31.662
Huey made a face and mimicked Cy.

85
00:04:31.663 --> 00:04:35.611
"Bobby, it's your turn," Cy said quickly.

86
00:04:35.612 --> 00:04:39.492
Bobby thought and thought.

87
00:04:39.493 --> 00:04:44.928
"If you don't have a wish," said Jane, "can I make one?"

88
00:04:44.929 --> 00:04:48.129
"Okay," Bobby said after a while.

89
00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.889
"But then it's my turn."

90
00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:54.776
"What is your wish, Jane?" Huey asked.

91
00:04:54.777 --> 00:04:59.236
Looking at each of her brothers and her sister, Jane said:

92
00:04:59.237 --> 00:05:04.878
"Huey, I wish we were grown up."

